Krita Nova 12 - preset previews: Quick Brush (Basic-1) and a cleaner fallback

"b) Basic-1" uses the Quick Brush engine (roundmarker). Patch 02's stroke
renderer skipped that engine, and its fallback cut a wide strip out of the
square thumbnail and stretched it over the row: a light background with a
huge dark blob, which looked broken.

1. KisPresetStrokeRenderer renders roundmarker presets live like any other
   engine (only clone and experiment presets are still skipped).
2. Quick Brush has no brush tip resource: its tip icon is a round dab in the
   theme's text color.
3. Fallback (while a stroke renders, and for clone/experiment presets): the
   whole thumbnail at row height on the panel background, no stretched strip.

